  "limits": [
    "Public versus private: popixoxipop-collab/backend-skeleton is public. popixoxipop-collab/backend-decoder and popixoxipop-collab/Backend-evaluation are private and answer 404 to the CI token, so CI recomputes only the recorded observation (hashes and derived facts) and the public bskel git objects. The decoder and evaluation head, blob, package and CI facts were read through an authenticated gh session at observed_at and can be re-checked only by running capture-observation.mjs again from such a session.",
    "A lock committed to main is always behind the main that contains it: the bskel head_sha is the main head before this change and later merges move main past it. verify-baseline reports that drift as HEAD_SHA_MISMATCH; re-baselining is a new capture, not an edit of this file.",
    "CI facts are historical: they describe the workflow runs that existed for the exact head SHA at observed_at. all_success is derived from those runs and is false when there are none; a skipped, cancelled or unfinished run is never counted as success.",
    "bskel exact-head CI: the push run and three scheduled runs succeeded. The scheduled run of 2026-10-06 failed in job test (24.x) with no step concluded as failure (the step run tests has no recorded conclusion), and its job log returned HTTP 404 on 2026-10-09 (manual check), so the cause is unknown. The scheduled runs of 2026-10-07 and 2026-10-08 failed only in job python-integration (step Run npm run test:python-integration), the failure PR 248 repairs; PR 248 was not merged at observed_at.",
