    "becoder exact-head CI: the push run and the scheduled Contract compatibility run succeeded; they are the only runs recorded for this head.",
    "Inventory pins: release/next/compatibility-inventory.json is owned by T23 and also carries per-head CI-run evidence, so this change does not edit it. The lock records how far each pinned commit is behind the observed head (inventory_pins); only the bskel relation can be recomputed from git in CI.",
    "No repository test suite is executed by this record. The exact-head CI runs are the only execution evidence and are taken as recorded; package.json scripts are identified by name and a canonical sha256, and the lockfile and workflow by git blob SHA, without examining their content.",
    "A GitHub observation has no work tree, so dirty is null. Checkout mode requires dirty=false and rejects unknown (DIRTY_STATE_UNKNOWN); only --remote accepts null, and only for an observation taken through GitHub.",
    "Only the default branch of each repository is pinned. Other branches, tags and the settings of the repositories are not part of this baseline."
